# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
ಔಟ್-ಪುಟ್ ಬರೆ: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), ಹೊಸ-ಸಾಲು.
ಔಟ್-ಪುಟ್ ಬರೆ: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), ಹೊಸ-ಸಾಲು.
ಔಟ್-ಪುಟ್ ಬರೆ: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), ಹೊಸ-ಸಾಲು.
ಔಟ್-ಪುಟ್ ಬರೆ: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), ಹೊಸ-ಸಾಲು.
ಔಟ್-ಪುಟ್ ಬರೆ: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), ಹೊಸ-ಸಾಲು.
ಔಟ್-ಪುಟ್ ಬರೆ: ([''] tccompare: ['']), ಹೊಸ-ಸಾಲು.
